<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Changing the application language</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp; Changing the application language
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="7" style=
    " page-break-inside: auto; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto;" cellspacing="0"
    bordercolor="#000000" width="490">
      <col width="229">
      <col width="231"><THEAD>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="474">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Use case: Changing the application language</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="474">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Actor: User</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Normal course</b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <b>Alternative courses</b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </THEAD><TBODY>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The opening of the language switching window of the application is
            selected from the main menu.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.The language switching window is presented with a sample text in the
            current language, and the defined languages are showed in a drop list.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.The user selects the required language.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">4.The window is updated based on new language selected.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.If the user accepts, an order is generated to update all elements of
            visual text of the application in the new language and this language is marked as
            user-preferred language in custom properties.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.1.If the user does not accept, it goes to point 6.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="229">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">6.The window is closed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="231">
          <p style=" widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </TBODY>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
